    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Having seen so many operations go belly-up as a result of poor timing, you've trained yourself to take action at the perfect moment.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combat_Reflexes\" title=\"Combat Reflexes\">Combat Reflexes</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Special_Initiative_Actions\" title=\"Special Initiative Actions\">Ready</a> a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Actions\" title=\"Full-Round Actions\">Full-Round Action</a>, provided you take no other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Actions_in_Combat\" title=\"Actions in Combat\">Actions</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Actions_in_Combat\" title=\"Actions in Combat\">Free Actions</a> excepted) prior to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Special_Initiative_Actions\" title=\"Special Initiative Actions\">Readying</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> If you have the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Versatility_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Versatility Talent Tree\">Ready and Willing</a></b> Talent, you can choose to keep your current <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative_Order\" title=\"Initiative Order\">Initiative Count</a> after taking your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Special_Initiative_Actions\" title=\"Special Initiative Actions\">Readied Action</a>, provided the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Special_Initiative_Actions\" title=\"Special Initiative Actions\">Readied Action</a> happens before the end of the current round.</p>",
